  "text": "Miami, Florida - U.S.A.\nEnglish\nEspañol\nРусский\nAbout us\nAreas of practice\nPeople\nNews & Articles\nOffices\nContact\nAbout Us\nDiaz Reus offers U.S. and international legal services. Our multidisciplinary team of attorneys provide legal representation in high-stakes litigation and precedent-setting legal matters in various areas of practice. Reach, experience, and acute know-how are the hallmarks of Diaz Reus international attorneys.\nU.S & International Practice\nMiami-headquartered Diaz Reus is a global legal practice focused on national and international parallel proceedings and business transactions in the following broad areas, with Board Certified lawyers in International Litigation & Arbitration, and International Law.\nLearn More\nDRT Alliance\nDRT International Law Firm & Alliance is a global network of law offices that provides clients seamless access to legal services in major business centers throughout the U.S., Latin America, Eastern and Western Europe, Asia, Africa and the Middle East.\nLearn More\nRepresentative Matters\n\nDiaz Reus’s extensive international legal experience spans the globe—from the US to Latin America and the Caribbean, from Western and Eastern Europe to the Middle East and Asia. Our multicultural, multilingual attorneys provide deft international legal representation in high-stakes litigation, precedent-setting legal matters and business transactions\n\nLearn More\nHonors & Recognitions\nDiaz Reus maintains leadership positions in professional and community organizations, being recognized for their abilities, professionalism, and high ethical standards, which are also reflected in the premier-quality legal product, value, and services for which the law firm is noted.\nLearn More\nHeadquarters:\nMiami Tower at International Place\n100 S.E. Second Street, Suite 3400\nMiami, FL 33131\n+1 . (877) . 247 . 92 . 77\n+1 . ( 305 ) . 375 . 92 . 20\ninfo@diazreus.com\nUSA & Canada\nMiami, Florida\nWashington, D.C.\nLos Angel